  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fcaa3a0cd03f0bc4b810ffa2e0c46f60, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  message:
  - You look inside the gardeners house.
  - There seems to be a large sign in the middle.
  - You try reading it.
  - '"Guide for myself"'
  - '"Good morning"'
  - '"Since i am quite forgetful, i wrote this list to help me not forget important
    things."'
  - '"The day starts with removing the leaves from the pathway."'
  - '"The main path is the entry which leads to the gate."'
  - '"Open the gate at 9:00"'
  - '"Close the gate at 19:00."'
  - '"The key for the gate is on top of the brown drawer with screws and bolts"'
  - Upon closer inspection the key seems to be gone.
  - The gardener should have the key with him.
  - You don't see an end to the list...
  - You decide to stop reading the sign.
